<section class="docs-section" aria-labelledby="mock">
  <h2 id="mock">Mock shop</h2>
  <p>Until step 4 connects Shopify, components run on mock products shaped exactly like Storefront API responses (<code>src/_data/mock.js</code>), and the cart talks to a pretend Storefront client that keeps the basket in your browser.</p>
